    "representation": "Nine exact pinned source section rune streams were checked against 56 site page JSON files. Forty-four pages enter at least one saved score completely and seven enter partially; four text pages plus empty LP2-50 are verified-only. F or EA stops are taken from committed db_indices and the source's first-20-interrupt cutoff.",
    "procedure": "Parse and independently recount every committed mirror/modulo database row with exact source group and skip-clock rules. Apply each of 24 source scoring arms to a planted known-text period-5 construction, then run a labeled post-target 49-replicate known-control shuffle diagnostic. Compute exact actual page contribution from scored rune positions.",
    "parameters": "Mirror a/b × high/norm (4 files), modulo-a and modulo-b for moduli 2/3 and all subgroups × high/norm (10 files each); 7,407 saved rows, 24 known-period controls, candidate periods 2–8, 49 post-target shuffles per control.",
    "exclusions": "No fresh search over all interruption masks; no LP2 selection-adjusted p-value, candidate key recovery, plaintext language test, OEIS database search or uncommitted source branch."
  },
